abstract: >-
  ENReT is a free statistical tool for fitting nonlinear models, developed in R
  as a Shiny web application, optimized for Food Science and Technology but
  usable in any field. It provides built-in and custom models, uncertainty
  estimation (linear approximation, profile likelihood and Monte Carlo),
  weighted least squares, residual diagnostics, model comparison, batch
  elaboration, shelf-life estimation and non-isothermal predictions, and was
  validated against certified and published reference data.
